00:07:28.055 --> 00:07:35.112
<v Slow>カグツチクラゲの名前は、何の神様から付けましたか。

00:07:35.911 --> 00:07:37.687
<v Host>The god of fire.

00:07:38.288 --> 00:07:56.192
<v Host>That's all for today. A newly discovered jellyfish named after the god of fire is now on display for the first time in the world, at two aquariums in Japan. If you visit this summer, you can see its long tentacles swaying like flames. Thank you for listening. See you tomorrow.

00:07:56.791 --> 00:07:59.192
